{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Visākhā","html":"<article id='thig1.13'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.13 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.13 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Visākhātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Visākhā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Visākhā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Karotha buddhasāsanaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Do the Buddha’s bidding, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“Do what the Buddha taught </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yaṁ katvā nānutappati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>you won’t regret it. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>and you will have no regrets. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Khippaṁ pādāni dhovitvā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Having quickly washed your feet, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Quickly wash your feet </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ekamante nisīdathā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>sit in a discreet place to meditate. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>and sit down to one side.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Visākhā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Visākhā </span></p></article>"}
